{"version":1,"key":"card:117","content":{"id":117,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"脚本在后台允许，在命令后加个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"&","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"#!/bin/zsh\n\ncount=5\nwhile [ \"$count\" -gt 0 ]\ndo\n\techo \"number$count\"\n\tcount=$[ $count - 1 ]\n\tsleep 1\ndone","language":"bash","uuid":"d5e5cab5-1e66-42a5-888b-b69d914ad884","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"xt in ~/shell/sig λ ./04.sh &\n[1] 1568\nnumber5\nxt in ~/shell/sig λ number4\nnumber3\nnumber2\nnumber1\n\n[1]  + 1568 done       ./04.sh","language":"bash","uuid":"71dc6c7d-6d90-498b-a2d8-d264117b12d8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"虽然程序在后台运行，但是输出还是在命令行，后台运行程序会输出"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"[1] 1568","language":"bash","uuid":"3a456fb6-5445-4a1c-88a7-9ea7048fb971","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"[1]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是作业号，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"1568","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是进程号，程序运行结束后输出"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"[1]  + 1568 done       ./04.sh","language":"bash","uuid":"b0538e80-f30c-4a2c-beb5-6eba071cb088","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果退出命令行时有后台运行的脚本，则会进行提示，不能退出，再次退出可以进行退出。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望退出命令行后还能在后台执行，使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nohup","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"nphup ./04.sh &","language":"bash","uuid":"d21b893a-897f-4ea6-b687-531c08a1500b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出会重定向到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"nohup.out","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件中"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"xt in ~/shell/sig λ nohup ./04.sh &\n[1] 1695\nxt in ~/shell/sig λ nohup: ignoring input and appending output to 'nohup.out'\n\n[1]  + 1695 done       nohup ./04.sh\nxt in ~/shell/sig λ cat nohup.out\nnumber5\nnumber4\nnumber3\nnumber2\nnumber1","language":"bash","uuid":"db7b0662-a1c2-4894-93bd-51d1d88fe2fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Linux/作业调度"],"createTime":1689256259305,"updateTime":1755938602511,"linkedCards":[{"id":97,"target":{"key":"card:97","type":"card","id":97},"summary":"作业控制：启动、停止、终止、恢复作业。 jobs 查看作业， Ctrl + Z 停止作业。 #!/bin/zsh count=3 while [ $count -gt 0 ] do echo \"Hello $count.\" sleep 2 ...","tags":["Linux/作业调度"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1755938602511}}